## Environment Variables
- `CRON_SECRET` — Random string for cron route protection

## Rate Limits & Safety
- 20s delay between requests per site
- Max 50 events per scrape run
- Dedup by source_url
- All events created as "draft" status by default
- Admin must approve before going live
